  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v4.9.2 stable: rolls up the rc.7-rc.30 series. **Headline:** OpenCL phi-binding-per-target codegen fix - `CLCodeGenerator.Terminators.cs` now mirrors `PTXCodeGenerator`'s `BindPhis(target)` approach so phi bindings emit only on the edge actually being taken, not unconditionally before the conditional branch. Closes Tuvok's `Av1RangeCoderGpu_CdfQ15_RoundTrip_AllBackends` (was 1/3 FAIL on OpenCL) and `Av1CoefDecoderGpu_RoundTrip_*` (was 4/15 FAIL on OpenCL) - 18/18 PASS post-fix across CPU + CUDA + OpenCL. Also rolled up: signed `Div by pow2` IR correctness (rc.28-29 - off-by-one for odd-negative dividends, gated on `(flags & ArithmeticFlags.Unsigned)`); IEEE 754 NaN/Inf codegen across WGSL/GLSL/Wasm/OpenCL (rc.26); Wasm wait/notify-free + worker-headroom default (rc.27); helper fn-definition emission for compile-cliff avoidance (rc.18); `AcceleratorRequirements` capability gating (rc.10); `UnsupportedKernelFeatureException` typed codegen errors (rc.10); `LocalMemory<T>(N >= 32)` WGSL codegen 5-layer fix (rc.10); Float16 (Half) everywhere - native or emulated; i64 `Atomic.Add` on WebGPU lock-free CAS loop; T4-drift CI guard + four-package version-sync CI guard. See [CHANGELOG.md](CHANGELOG.md) for the full per-version history.",
